WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.110
Tom jumped to his feet.

2
00:00:18.111 --> 00:00:23.229
"So you're awake, Wizard!" Daimon said.

3
00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:26.067
Cat leaped onto Tom's shoulder.

4
00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:28.696
She whispered in his ear.

5
00:00:28.697 --> 00:00:31.423
Daimon had a wicked grin.

6
00:00:31.424 --> 00:00:36.528
"Maybe I'll change you into a mouse," he said.

7
00:00:36.529 --> 00:00:42.825
"Then your pet cat can have fun with you!"

8
00:00:42.826 --> 00:00:45.098
Tom waved his wand.

9
00:00:45.099 --> 00:00:48.607
"Rain!" he whispered nervously.

10
00:00:48.608 --> 00:00:53.745
Poof! Marbles fell from the ceiling.

11
00:00:53.746 --> 00:00:55.707
"Oops," Tom said.

12
00:00:55.708 --> 00:00:59.443
"Ouch!" Daimon cried as marbles hit him.

13
00:00:59.444 --> 00:01:01.288
Daimon jumped out of the way.

14
00:01:01.289 --> 00:01:02.856
He bumped into the tub.

15
00:01:02.857 --> 00:01:04.988
Cat ran between Daimon's feet.

16
00:01:04.989 --> 00:01:06.359
Daimon tripped!

17
00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:09.702
Splash! Daimon fell into the tub.

18
00:01:09.703 --> 00:01:14.939
"Help!" he cried. "I hate water!"

19
00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:21.364
Daimon waved his wand but nothing happened.

20
00:01:21.365 --> 00:01:23.389
Tom looked at Cat.

21
00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:25.198
"You were right.

22
00:01:25.199 --> 00:01:34.088
Water makes Daimon's magic stop working!"

23
00:01:34.089 --> 00:01:39.924
Everyone woke up.

24
00:01:39.925 --> 00:01:45.630
"Good job, Tom!" Ann said.

25
00:01:45.631 --> 00:01:55.913
She waved her wand and tied up Daimon.

26
00:01:55.914 --> 00:02:02.198
Guards brought Daimon to the Grim Dungeon.

27
00:02:02.199 --> 00:02:08.544
They let out the king and Dirk.

28
00:02:08.545 --> 00:02:12.367
"You saved us, Daughter!" Dirk cried.

29
00:02:12.368 --> 00:02:14.132
Ann shook her head.

30
00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:17.381
"It was Tom, Father."

31
00:02:17.382 --> 00:02:19.241
Dirk scowled.

32
00:02:19.242 --> 00:02:22.155
"Thank you, Tom. I guess."

33
00:02:22.156 --> 00:02:26.271
The king was beaming.

34
00:02:26.272 --> 00:02:30.911
"How can I ever thank you, Tom?" said the king.

35
00:02:30.912 --> 00:02:32.387
Tom bowed.

36
00:02:32.388 --> 00:02:35.427
"It's my job, Your Majesty.

37
00:02:35.428 --> 00:02:39.389
I use magic to help people."

38
00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:49.187
Cat purred.
